CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17 --unwind 8 --no-unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ variable template: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ variable: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
The constant evaluator could not assign to an element of a member array,
so the constexpr objects were initialized at startup; --unwind 8 cut the
100-iteration loop and made main unreachable (every assertion vacuous).
